    "detailed_description": "<h1>Click the Discord link in the sidebar to join the community and get early previews of Updates!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/cff7734e2a5984b3cb74eaa77c7eab2a.poster.avif?t=1735346175\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/cff7734e2a5984b3cb74eaa77c7eab2a.gif?t=1735346175\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Siphonogore is a roguelike turn-based rpg mixed with a choose your own adventure game, where your choices and strategies matter.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/009638023e5e4cd93e3a9b6da3938725.poster.avif?t=1735346175\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/009638023e5e4cd93e3a9b6da3938725.apng?t=1735346175\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=156 /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully Catered &amp; Randomly Encountered Combat Challenges<br></li><li>Robust Choose Your Own Adventure Sections<br></li><li>Evolving Combat Strategies &amp; Unlockable Adventuring Options<br></li><li>A Customizable Body with new unlockable parts</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.poster.avif?t=1735346175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.webm?t=1735346175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.mp4?t=1735346175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Siphonogore's Turn-Based combat challenges are designed to create fun, engaging, and unique encounters.  Enemies are designed to act both together and independently, with a common specialized strategy you'll have to discover and play around.<br>After every combat encounter, the remains are consumed and turned into biomass, granting access to mutations: specializations, new moves, move modifications, stat upgrades, or modifications to enemy behavior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/7083904964c9ecab712ea61b0c62aff9.avif?t=1735346175\" width=616 height=190 /></span><br>You'll find yourself given a choice between points of interest to follow - your decision brings you to a Choose Your Own Adventure styled segment with branching paths and different outcomes. Though acting recklessly may increase the risk of getting hurt, well planned recklessness may provide rewards. Moves, mutations, and more add additional options and lines of action to these already broad pathways.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Siphonogore is a roguelike turn-based rpg mixed with a choose your own adventure game, where your choices and strategies matter.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/009638023e5e4cd93e3a9b6da3938725.poster.avif?t=1735346175\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/009638023e5e4cd93e3a9b6da3938725.apng?t=1735346175\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=156 /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully Catered &amp; Randomly Encountered Combat Challenges<br></li><li>Robust Choose Your Own Adventure Sections<br></li><li>Evolving Combat Strategies &amp; Unlockable Adventuring Options<br></li><li>A Customizable Body with new unlockable parts</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.poster.avif?t=1735346175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.webm?t=1735346175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/a67b4bc50b86359ee206b9f1c898027a.mp4?t=1735346175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Siphonogore's Turn-Based combat challenges are designed to create fun, engaging, and unique encounters.  Enemies are designed to act both together and independently, with a common specialized strategy you'll have to discover and play around.<br>After every combat encounter, the remains are consumed and turned into biomass, granting access to mutations: specializations, new moves, move modifications, stat upgrades, or modifications to enemy behavior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815560/extras/7083904964c9ecab712ea61b0c62aff9.avif?t=1735346175\" width=616 height=190 /></span><br>You'll find yourself given a choice between points of interest to follow - your decision brings you to a Choose Your Own Adventure styled segment with branching paths and different outcomes. Though acting recklessly may increase the risk of getting hurt, well planned recklessness may provide rewards. Moves, mutations, and more add additional options and lines of action to these already broad pathways.",
    "short_description": "Siphonogore is a Hemothematic Turn-Based Roguelike Dungeon Crawler. The world is meat; calloused and rotten. Within the hollow husk of a sleeping god a war rages for the source of its power. Control a cobbled together creature of obscure origin, a self-made successor, here to take what is yours.",
